{"title":"Ceramics class mix","genre":"analysis","brief":"Complete the following real project in the current, initially empty directory. Choose the deliverables, media, tools, structure and implementation that serve the intended user. Build usable artifacts and check your work. Deliver the project itself. Omit personally identifying credits, author signatures and model or toolchain identity labels. No network access or credentials are provided.\n\nA community ceramics studio can schedule six classes next term. Its manager wants a class mix that covers direct costs while leaving at least two slots for beginners. Fictional historical enrollment for the last four sessions of each format: beginner wheel 7, 8, 6, 8; handbuilding 5, 6, 4, 6; glazing workshop 4, 5, 5, 6. Price, materials per attendee, and instructor cost per session are respectively $45, $9, $120 for wheel; $38, $6, $95 for handbuilding; $32, $8, $80 for glazing. Only beginner wheel counts toward the beginner requirement. Compare margins and test a one-attendee decline per class. Start from an empty directory and choose offline deliverables.","works":{"27e54c36ef25c6f4":{"files":[{"name":"Ceramics Term Planner.xlsx","bytes":6790,"sha256":"626336383b8de347bca72dfc7cbb0efbc7c9e0a9470d5529acdf1a9288051388","kind":"sheet","sheet":{"name":"Planner","rows":[["Ceramics studio   /   Term planner"],["Schedule six classes, including at least two beginner wheel sessions. Amounts cover materials and instructors."],[],["Recommended schedule with the supplied data"],["Book six beginner wheel classes. Wheel earns the highest margin per class at both attendance levels."],["For all three formats, four wheel, one handbuilding and one glazing earns $677 at baseline and $477 after the decline."],[],["Try a schedule   /   Edit the blue class counts"],["Format","Class count","Expected seats¹","Base margin","Margin −1"],["Beginner wheel","6","43.5","846","630"],["Handbuilding","0","0.0","0","0"],["Glazing workshop","0","0.0","0","0"]]}}],"download":"data/release/assets/64be4b34f03a890eff2b8c2ab721b7e4c9b890f17c2e30d222ce991837c8f45e.zip"},"6d4a8e082a785e7a":{"files":[{"name":"ceramics-schedule-mixes.csv","bytes":459,"sha256":"0c4633bd64d793d0c595eb94cf39862b99e2ce4ff42faa6d43fe9dde3ebca57f","kind":"text","body":"Beginner wheel sessions,Handbuilding sessions,Glazing workshop sessions,Baseline direct margin USD,Stress direct margin USD (one fewer attendee per session),Margin drop USD\r\n6,0,0,846,630,216\r\n5,1,0,778,566,212\r\n5,0,1,745,541,204\r\n4,2,0,710,502,208\r\n4,1,1,677,477,200\r\n4,0,2,644,452,192\r\n3,3,0,642,438,204\r\n3,2,1,609,413,196\r\n3,1,2,576,388,188\r\n2,4,0,574,374,200\r\n3,0,3,543,363,180\r\n2,3,1,541,349,192\r\n2,2,2,508,324,184\r\n2,1,3,475,299,176\r\n2,0,4,442,274,168\r\n"},{"name":"index.html","bytes":22374,"sha256":"db0b69482111171a6850ad67629bb23974e3bed7f7940e74858d9d6a5de75412","kind":"text","body":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Ceramics Studio · Class Mix Planner</title>\n<style>\n  :root {\n    color-scheme: light;\n    --paper: #f6f2e9;\n    --surface: #fffcf6;\n    --ink: #252b24;\n    --muted: #555e51;\n    --line: #d7d4c7;\n    --forest: #263d32;\n    --on-forest: #f9f5e8;\n    --forest-muted: #d7e1d6;\n    --clay: #863d28;\n    --clay-light: #f0d8ca;\n    --sage: #dce7da;\n    --sand: #eae2cb;\n    --serif: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    --sans: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;\n    font: 100% / 1.55 var(--sans);\n    background: var(--paper);\n    color: var(--ink);\n  }\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body { margin: 0; }\n  a { color: inherit; }\n  a, button, select { touch-action: manipulation; }\n  :focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--clay); outline-offset: 3px; }\n  .wrap { width: min(74rem, 100% - 4rem); margin-inline: auto; }\n  .skip { position: absolute; left: 1rem; top: 1rem; transform: translateY(-200%); padding: .6rem 1rem; background: var(--surface); z-index: 2; }\n  .skip:focus { transform: none; }\n  .masthead { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  .masthead .wrap { min-height: 4.5rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: .75rem 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n  .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .65rem; font-weight: 700; }\n  .mark { width: 1.45rem; aspect-ratio: 1; border: 1.5px solid var(--clay); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 3px var(--paper), inset 0 0 0 4.5px var(--clay); }\n  nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.4rem; }\n  nav a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; text-decoration: none; font-size: .875rem; color: var(--muted); }\n  nav a:hover { color: var(--clay); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: .2em; }\n  button, select { min-height: 44px; font: inherit; color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid #a7a99d; border-radius: .4rem; background: var(--surface); }\n  button { cursor: pointer; font-size: .875rem; font-weight: 700; padding: .55rem 1rem; }\n  button:hover { background: var(--sage); }\n  button:active { background: #cddccd; }\n  select { padding: .5rem .65rem; max-width: 100%; }\n  h1, h2, h3, p { margin: 0; }\n  h1, h2, .mix-number, .big-money { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; }\n  h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 6.4vw, 5.75rem); line-height: .99; letter-spacing: -.06em; max-width: 10ch; }\n  h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.4vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -.045em; }\n  h3 { font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.25; }\n  .eyebrow { font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: .13em; text-transform: uppercase; }\n  .hero { padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5.25rem) 2rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.16fr; gap: 2rem clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem); align-items: center; }\n  .hero-copy .eyebrow { color: var(--clay); margin-bottom: .85rem; }\n  .intro { color: var(--muted); max-width: 36ch; margin-top: 1.35rem; font-size: 1.075rem; }\n  .recommend { padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2rem); background: var(--forest); color: var(--on-forest); border-radius: .9rem; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px #263d3210; }\n  .recommend .eyebrow { color: var(--forest-muted); margin-bottom: .55rem; }\n  .recommend h2 { font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.6rem); }\n  .slots { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 1.15rem 0 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); gap: .35rem; }\n  .slots li { display: grid; border-radius: .3rem; min-height: 2.2rem; place-items: center; background: var(--clay-light); color: var(--clay); font-size: .76rem; font-weight: 750; }\n  .slots abbr { text-decoration: none; }\n  .rec-margins { margin: 1.3rem 0 0; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid #ffffff45; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }\n  .rec-margins div { display: flex; flex-direction: column-reverse; gap: .25rem; }\n  .rec-margins dt { color: var(--forest-muted); font-size: .8rem; }\n  .big-money { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.035em; font-variant-numeric: lining-nums tabular-nums; }\n  .alternative { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: .45rem 1.5rem; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--clay); border-radius: 0 .45rem .45rem 0; background: #eee4d5; }\n  .alternative h2 { font: 750 1rem / 1.4 var(--sans); }\n  .alternative p { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }\n  .alt-money { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n  .section { padding-top: 3.5rem; scroll-margin-top: 1rem; }\n  .section-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: .75rem 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.15rem; }\n  .section-head p { margin-top: .45rem; color: var(--muted); }\n  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem 1.25rem; font-size: .825rem; color: var(--muted); }\n  .legend span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; }\n  .legend i { width: .75rem; height: .75rem; border-radius: .15rem; background: var(--forest); }\n  .legend .stress { background: var(--clay); }\n  .formats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }\n  .format { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: .65rem; padding: 1.15rem; }\n  .format-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .4rem .65rem; }\n  .tag { font-size: .75rem; color: #2d4837; background: var(--sage); border-radius: .25rem; padding: .1rem .4rem; font-weight: 700; }\n  .history { font-size: .825rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: .4rem; }\n  .plot { display: grid; gap: .55rem; margin-top: 1.05rem; }\n  .plot-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 3.25rem; gap: .6rem; align-items: center; font-size: .875rem; }\n  .track { height: .6rem; border-radius: .2rem; background: #edeae1; overflow: hidden; }\n  .bar { display: block; height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; background: var(--forest); }\n  .bar.stress { background: var(--clay); }\n  .plot-row strong { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n  .facts { margin: 1rem 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: .8rem; font-size: .825rem; }\n  .facts div { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: .4rem; }\n  .facts div + div { margin-top: .23rem; }\n  .facts dt { color: var(--muted); }\n  .facts dd { margin: 0; font-weight: 650; text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n  .panel { border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); border-radius: .65rem; overflow: hidden; }\n  .filters { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: end; gap: .7rem 1rem; padding: 1rem 1.15rem; }\n  .filters label { display: grid; gap: .25rem; font-size: .825rem; font-weight: 700; }\n  .filters label.checkbox { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; min-height: 44px; cursor: pointer; }\n  input[type=\"checkbox\"] { width: 1.15rem; height: 1.15rem; accent-color: var(--forest); margin: 0; }\n  .results-count { align-self: center; margin-left: auto; color: var(--muted); font-size: .825rem; }\n  .table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }\n  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .9rem; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; text-align: right; }\n  th, td { padding: .65rem 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  thead th { background: #ede9dc; color: #434c40; font-size: .8rem; vertical-align: bottom; }\n  tbody th { font-weight: 550; }\n  tbody td:nth-last-child(2) { font-weight: 750; }\n  tbody td:last-child { color: var(--muted); }\n  tbody tr[data-highlight] { background: #e7eee3; }\n  tbody tr[data-highlight] th { font-weight: 800; }\n  .table-foot { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: .65rem 1.15rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: .825rem; }\n  .notes { margin-block: 3rem 3.5rem; padding-top: 1.25rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  .notes h2 { font-size: 1.65rem; }\n  .notes-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem 2rem; margin-top: .7rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: .885rem; }\n  .notes strong { color: var(--ink); }\n  .sr-only { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip-path: inset(50%); white-space: nowrap; border: 0; }\n  .print-only, .short { display: none; }\n  @media (max-width: 53rem) {\n    .wrap { width: calc(100% - 2.5rem); }\n    .hero { gap: 1.75rem; }\n    .formats { gap: .6rem; }\n    .format { padding: .85rem; }\n    th, td { padding-inline: .7rem; }\n  }\n  @media screen and (max-width: 40rem) {\n    .wrap { width: calc(100% - 2rem); }\n    .masthead .wrap { gap: 0 .75rem; padding-block: .5rem; }\n    nav { gap: .85rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n    .hero, .formats, .notes-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .section { padding-top: 2.5rem; }\n    .filters { padding: .75rem; column-gap: .65rem; }\n    .results-count { margin-left: 0; }\n    th, td { padding: .6rem .22rem; font-size: .8125rem; text-align: center; }\n    thead th { font-size: .75rem; line-height: 1.25; }\n    .long { display: none; }\n    .short { display: inline; }\n    .table-foot { padding-inline: .75rem; }\n  }\n  @media print {\n    @page { margin: .35in; }\n    :root { background: white; font-size: 9.5pt; line-height: 1.35; print-color-adjust: exact; }\n    .wrap { width: 100%; }\n    .masthead .wrap { min-height: 2rem; }\n    nav, .skip, .filters, #export, #screen-rows, .hero-copy .eyebrow, .slots, .tag { display: none; }\n    .print-only { display: revert; }\n    .hero { padding-block: .65rem; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr; gap: 1rem; }\n    h1 { font-size: 27pt; max-width: none; }\n    h2 { font-size: 19pt; }\n    .intro { margin-top: .5rem; max-width: none; font-size: 9.5pt; }\n    .recommend { box-shadow: none; padding: .85rem; }\n    .recommend h2 { font-size: 17pt; }\n    .rec-margins { padding-top: .6rem; margin-top: .65rem; }\n    .big-money { font-size: 20pt; }\n    .alternative { padding-block: .5rem; }\n    .formats { gap: .6rem; }\n    .format { padding: .65rem; break-inside: avoid; }\n    .plot { margin-top: .6rem; gap: .25rem; }\n    .facts { margin-top: .55rem; padding-top: .5rem; }\n    .section { padding-top: .85rem; }\n    .section-head { margin-bottom: .45rem; break-after: avoid; }\n    th, td { padding: .10rem .5rem; }\n    .panel, .table-scroll { overflow: visible; }\n    tr { break-inside: avoid; }\n    .notes { margin-block: .8rem 0; padding-top: .55rem; break-inside: avoid; }\n    .notes-grid { margin-top: .35rem; }\n    .alternative, .hero { break-inside: avoid; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to planner</a>\n<header class=\"masthead\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"brand\"><span class=\"mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> Ceramics Studio</div>\n    <nav aria-label=\"Planner sections\">\n      <a href=\"#formats\">Class formats</a>\n      <a href=\"#mixes\">Schedule mixes</a>\n      <button id=\"print\" type=\"button\">Print plan</button>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</header>\n<main class=\"wrap\" id=\"main\">\n  <section aria-labelledby=\"title\">\n    <div class=\"hero\">\n      <div class=\"hero-copy\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Term planning</p>\n        <h1 id=\"title\">Next term’s class mix</h1>\n        <p class=\"intro\">Six sessions total, including at least two beginner wheel sessions. Compare what each mix leaves after direct costs.</p>\n      </div>\n      <article class=\"recommend\" aria-labelledby=\"best-title\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Highest projected margin</p>\n        <h2 id=\"best-title\"></h2>\n        <ol class=\"slots\" id=\"best-slots\" aria-label=\"Recommended schedule\"></ol>\n        <dl class=\"rec-margins\">\n          <div><dt>Baseline term margin</dt><dd class=\"big-money\" id=\"best-base\"></dd></div>\n          <div><dt>With one fewer attendee per class</dt><dd class=\"big-money\" id=\"best-stress\"></dd></div>\n        </dl>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n    <aside class=\"alternative\" aria-labelledby=\"alternative-title\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 id=\"alternative-title\">If you want all three formats</h2>\n        <p id=\"alternative-mix\"></p>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"alt-money\" id=\"alternative-money\"></p>\n    </aside>\n    <noscript><p>Enable JavaScript in your browser to calculate and display the comparisons.</p></noscript>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"formats\" aria-labelledby=\"formats-title\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 id=\"formats-title\">Margin by class format</h2>\n        <p>Projected dollars per session. The bars share a common scale.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"legend\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <span><i></i> Baseline</span>\n        <span><i class=\"stress\"></i> One fewer attendee</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"formats\" id=\"format-cards\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"mixes\" aria-labelledby=\"mixes-title\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 id=\"mixes-title\">Compare six-session mixes</h2>\n        <p id=\"coverage\"></p>\n      </div>\n      <button id=\"export\" type=\"button\">Download all mixes as CSV</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"panel\">\n      <div class=\"filters\">\n        <label>Wheel sessions\n          <select id=\"wheel-filter\">\n            <option value=\"\">Any (2–6)</option>\n            <option>2</option><option>3</option><option>4</option><option>5</option><option>6</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <label>Sort by\n          <select id=\"sort\">\n            <option value=\"base\">Baseline margin</option>\n            <option value=\"stress\">Stress margin</option>\n            <option value=\"drop\">Smallest margin drop</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"checkbox\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"diverse-filter\"> Include all three formats</label>\n        <p class=\"results-count\" id=\"results-count\" role=\"status\"></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Schedule mix results\">\n        <table aria-describedby=\"table-foot\">\n          <caption class=\"sr-only\">Projected term margins by class schedule</caption>\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th scope=\"col\">Wheel</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"long\">Handbuilding</span><span class=\"short\">Hand<span class=\"sr-only\">building</span></span></th>\n              <th scope=\"col\">Glazing</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\">Baseline<span class=\"sr-only\"> margin</span></th>\n              <th scope=\"col\">Stress<span class=\"sr-only\"> margin</span></th>\n              <th scope=\"col\">Drop</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody id=\"screen-rows\"></tbody>\n          <tbody class=\"print-only\" id=\"print-rows\"></tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"table-foot\" id=\"table-foot\">Stress margin assumes one fewer attendee in each of the six sessions. Drop is the difference from baseline.</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer class=\"notes\" aria-labelledby=\"method-title\">\n    <h2 id=\"method-title\">How the projections work</h2>\n    <div class=\"notes-grid\">\n      <p><strong>Enrollment.</strong> Baseline uses the exact mean of four fictional historical sessions per format. The stress case subtracts one from each mean. Fractional averages are kept for projections.</p>\n      <p><strong>Direct costs.</strong> Session margin is attendance × (price − materials per attendee) − instructor cost. Term margin sums the six session margins. Break-even is the minimum whole-person attendance that covers those costs. Overhead is outside this calculation.</p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n</main>\n<script>\n  const sessionCount = 6;\n  const beginnerMinimum = 2;\n  const formats = [\n    { name: \"Beginner wheel\", slot: \"Wheel\", history: [7, 8, 6, 8], price: 45, materials: 9, instructor: 120, beginner: true },\n    { name: \"Handbuilding\", slot: \"Hand\", history: [5, 6, 4, 6], price: 38, materials: 6, instructor: 95 },\n    { name: \"Glazing workshop\", slot: \"Glaze\", history: [4, 5, 5, 6], price: 32, materials: 8, instructor: 80 },\n  ].map(format => {\n    const attendance = format.history.reduce((sum, count) => sum + count, 0) / format.history.length;\n    const perAttendee = format.price - format.materials;\n    return {\n      ...format,\n      attendance,\n      stressAttendance: attendance - 1,\n      base: attendance * perAttendee - format.instructor,\n      stress: (attendance - 1) * perAttendee - format.instructor,\n      breakEven: Math.ceil(format.instructor / perAttendee),\n    };\n  });\n\n  const mixes = [];\n  for (let wheel = beginnerMinimum; wheel <= sessionCount; wheel++) {\n    for (let handbuilding = 0; handbuilding <= sessionCount - wheel; handbuilding++) {\n      const glazing = sessionCount - wheel - handbuilding;\n      const counts = [wheel, handbuilding, glazing];\n      const base = formats.reduce((sum, format, index) => sum + format.base * counts[index], 0);\n      const stress = formats.reduce((sum, format, index) => sum + format.stress * counts[index], 0);\n      mixes.push({ wheel, handbuilding, glazing, counts, base, stress, drop: base - stress });\n    }\n  }\n  mixes.sort((a, b) => b.base - a.base || b.stress - a.stress);\n  const best = mixes[0];\n  const diverse = mix => mix.counts.every(count => count > 0);\n  const bestDiverse = mixes.find(diverse);\n\n  const byId = id => document.getElementById(id);\n  const currency = new Intl.NumberFormat(\"en-US\", {\n    style: \"currency\", currency: \"USD\", minimumFractionDigits: 0, maximumFractionDigits: 2,\n  });\n  const dollars = amount => currency.format(amount);\n\n  function describeMix(mix) {\n    return formats.flatMap((format, index) => {\n      const count = mix.counts[index];\n      return count ? [`${count} ${format.name.toLowerCase()}`] : [];\n    }).join(\" · \");\n  }\n\n  byId(\"best-title\").textContent = best.wheel === sessionCount\n    ? `${best.wheel} beginner wheel sessions`\n    : describeMix(best);\n  byId(\"best-slots\").innerHTML = formats.flatMap((format, index) =>\n    Array.from({ length: best.counts[index] }, () => `<li><abbr title=\"${format.name}\">${format.slot}</abbr></li>`)\n  ).join(\"\");\n  byId(\"best-base\").textContent = dollars(best.base);\n  byId(\"best-stress\").textContent = dollars(best.stress);\n  byId(\"alternative-mix\").textContent = describeMix(bestDiverse);\n  byId(\"alternative-money\").innerHTML = `<strong>${dollars(bestDiverse.base)}</strong> baseline · <strong>${dollars(bestDiverse.stress)}</strong> with one fewer per class`;\n\n  const barLimit = Math.ceil(Math.max(...formats.map(format => format.base)) / 10) * 10;\n  byId(\"format-cards\").innerHTML = formats.map(format => `\n    <article class=\"format\">\n      <div class=\"format-head\"><h3>${format.name}</h3>${format.beginner ? '<span class=\"tag\">Counts toward minimum</span>' : ''}</div>\n      <p class=\"history\">Past enrollments · ${format.history.join(\", \")}</p>\n      <div class=\"plot\">\n        <div class=\"plot-row\">\n          <span class=\"track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"bar\" style=\"width:${format.base / barLimit * 100}%\"></span></span>\n          <strong><span class=\"sr-only\">Baseline margin </span>${dollars(format.base)}</strong>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plot-row\">\n          <span class=\"track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"bar stress\" style=\"width:${format.stress / barLimit * 100}%\"></span></span>\n          <strong><span class=\"sr-only\">Stress margin </span>${dollars(format.stress)}</strong>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <dl class=\"facts\">\n        <div><dt>Baseline attendance</dt><dd>${format.attendance}</dd></div>\n        <div><dt>Stress attendance</dt><dd>${format.stressAttendance}</dd></div>\n        <div><dt>Break-even attendance</dt><dd>${format.breakEven}</dd></div>\n        <div><dt>Price / materials per person</dt><dd>${dollars(format.price)} / ${dollars(format.materials)}</dd></div>\n        <div><dt>Instructor per session</dt><dd>${dollars(format.instructor)}</dd></div>\n      </dl>\n    </article>\n  `).join(\"\");\n\n  const stressMinimum = Math.min(...mixes.map(mix => mix.stress));\n  const covered = mixes.filter(mix => mix.stress >= 0).length;\n  byId(\"coverage\").textContent = `${covered} of ${mixes.length} eligible mixes cover direct costs under stress. The lowest stress margin is ${dollars(stressMinimum)}.`;\n\n  function renderRows(rows) {\n    if (!rows.length) {\n      return '<tr><td colspan=\"6\">No mixes match these filters.</td></tr>';\n    }\n    return rows.map(mix => `\n      <tr ${mix === best ? \"data-highlight\" : \"\"}>\n        <th scope=\"row\">${mix.wheel}${mix === best ? '<span class=\"sr-only\"> (highest projected margin)</span>' : ''}</th>\n        <td>${mix.handbuilding}</td><td>${mix.glazing}</td>\n        <td>${dollars(mix.base)}</td><td>${dollars(mix.stress)}</td><td>${dollars(mix.drop)}</td>\n      </tr>\n    `).join(\"\");\n  }\n\n  const wheelFilter = byId(\"wheel-filter\");\n  const diverseFilter = byId(\"diverse-filter\");\n  const sort = byId(\"sort\");\n  function updateMixes() {\n    const filtered = mixes.filter(mix =>\n      (!wheelFilter.value || mix.wheel === Number(wheelFilter.value)) &&\n      (!diverseFilter.checked || diverse(mix))\n    );\n    const metric = sort.value;\n    filtered.sort((a, b) => metric === \"drop\" ? a.drop - b.drop : b[metric] - a[metric]);\n    byId(\"screen-rows\").innerHTML = renderRows(filtered);\n    byId(\"results-count\").textContent = `Showing ${filtered.length} of ${mixes.length} mixes`;\n  }\n  [wheelFilter, diverseFilter, sort].forEach(control => control.addEventListener(\"change\", updateMixes));\n  byId(\"print-rows\").innerHTML = renderRows(mixes);\n  updateMixes();\n\n  byId(\"print\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => window.print());\n  byId(\"export\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n    const header = [\"Beginner wheel sessions\", \"Handbuilding sessions\", \"Glazing workshop sessions\",\n      \"Baseline direct margin USD\", \"Stress direct margin USD (one fewer attendee per session)\", \"Margin drop USD\"];\n    const rows = mixes.map(mix => [...mix.counts, mix.base, mix.stress, mix.drop]);\n    const csv = [header, ...rows].map(row => row.join(\",\")).join(\"\\r\\n\") + \"\\r\\n\";\n    const url = URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([csv], { type: \"text/csv;charset=utf-8\" }));\n    const link = document.createElement(\"a\");\n    link.href = url;\n    link.download = \"ceramics-schedule-mixes.csv\";\n    document.body.append(link);\n    link.click();\n    link.remove();\n    setTimeout(() => URL.revokeObjectURL(url), 1000);\n  });\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}],"download":"data/release/assets/4163415bc7dd204746043f50df81511f306c8af48d029bbf4a3db4ed902b4743.zip"}}}
